The change:
The Ship methods of the 50 carriers in package freight (Truck, Train, Plane, Vessel, Van, Freighter, Drone, Barge, Courier and Post, and their numbered copies Truck2 to Post5) do nearly the same thing. Make all 50 call one package-level function dispatch(shipped *[]string, mode, to, text string), which logs "<mode> ship to <to>" with the standard logger and appends "<to>: <text>" to *shipped. What they ship and log must not change.
